<p><span class="err-word">Because of the cause from those hasty belief lead to</span> <span class="fix">Because hasty beliefs can lead to serious consequences</span> <span class="why">COHERENCE COHESION: cụm mở đoạn rối, lặp “cause/lead to” và thiếu mạch lập luận.</span>, we are now more <span class="err-word">concern</span> <span class="fix">concerned</span> <span class="why">GR: sau “be” cần tính từ/phân từ “concerned”.</span> about the need <span class="err-word">of given</span> <span class="fix">to provide</span> <span class="why">GR: “the need to do something”.</span> possible solutions to <span class="err-word">raise up</span> <span class="fix">raise</span> <span class="why">VC: “raise awareness/critical thinking”; không dùng “raise up”.</span> the critical thinking of the mass. First, each person <span class="err-word">need</span> <span class="fix">needs</span> <span class="why">GR: chủ ngữ số ít “each person” cần “needs”.</span> to practise <span class="err-word">starting giving out question</span> <span class="fix">asking questions</span> <span class="why">VC: collocation đúng là “ask questions”.</span> such as: “Where did this information come from?” and “What is the essence of this post?” They need to keep themselves cool and calm, find out the origin and author of the information, and decide <span class="err-word">wherever</span> <span class="fix">whether</span> <span class="why">VC: “whether” dùng để nêu lựa chọn tin hay không tin.</span> to believe it or not.</p>
